[17.032,"o","── PLAN · nothing below has run ───────────────────────────────────────\r\nThis is what ov does in your AWS account (region eu-south-2); --debug shows every command:\r\n\r\n  1. SSH key: import the stack's own key pair into the region (.openvidu/aws/openvidu-e2e-aws-ce-a105835-key.pem)\r\n  2. Template: render the single node template into .openvidu/aws/cf-openvidu-singlenode.yaml\r\n     and its parameters into .openvidu/aws/cfn-parameters.json (0600)\r\n  3. Bucket: stage the template in the S3 bucket openvidu-cfn-templates-***-eu-south-2 (created once, reused by every stack)\r\n  4. Network: the region's default VPC, vpc-0e2358cb016b9fef5 (the template places the machine there)\r\n  5. Machines: Create the CloudFormation stack openvidu-e2e-aws-ce-a105835 with the machine, which installs OpenVidu Community on itself (about 10 minutes)\r\n  6. Wait for OpenVidu to answer, read the stack over SSH and register this directory as the stack\r\n── end of plan ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n\r\n▶ Create the machines on AWS…\r\n   · SSH key pair for this stack: .openvidu/aws/openvidu-e2e-aws-ce-a105835-key.pem\r\n"]
[17.737,"o","   · import its public half into eu-south-2 as the key pair openvidu-e2e-aws-ce-a105835-key\r\n"]
[19.811,"o","   · create the CloudFormation stack openvidu-e2e-aws-ce-a105835 from .openvidu/aws/cf-openvidu-singlenode.yaml (this returns when CloudFormation is done)\r\n"]
[24.811,"o","note: recorded this stack's infrastructure in openvidu-stack.yml, so `ov stack destroy` removes it even if the wait below fails\r\n   ✓ Create the machines on AWS\r\n\r\n▶ Wait for the machines to deploy OpenVidu…\r\n"]
[25.998,"o","   · OpenVidu is up: the stack published its URL and https://openvidu-dq85bx-35-43-163-131.sslip.io/health/caddy answers 200\r\n   ✓ Wait for the machines to deploy OpenVidu\r\n\r\n▶ Register the stack…\r\n"]
[28.016,"o","\r\nStack described by the deployment:\r\n  name         openvidu-e2e-aws-ce-a105835\r\n  deployment   single_node · aws · community\r\n  version      ov-admin\r\n  modules      dashboard, egress, ingress, meet, observability\r\n  dashboard    https://openvidu-dq85bx-35-43-163-131.sslip.io\r\n  nodes        35.43.163.131\r\n  published    by ov/ov-admin on 2026-11-13 11:05 UTC (generation 1)\r\n\r\n"]
[28.017,"o","note: this stack was deployed on the machine itself, so its desired state named 127.0.0.1; retargeted at 35.43.163.131, the host this import reached\r\n"]
[28.022,"o","✔ registered stack \"openvidu-e2e-aws-ce-a105835\" in <run>/openvidu-e2e-aws-ce-a105835/stack\r\n   ✓ Register the stack\r\n\r\n✔ OpenVidu Community (single node) is up on AWS\r\n  URL:          https://openvidu-dq85bx-35-43-163-131.sslip.io/\r\n"]
