[45.312,"o","── PLAN · nothing below has run ───────────────────────────────────────\r\nThis is what will be deleted from your AWS account:\r\n\r\n  # The instance, its Elastic IP, its security group and the secret.\r\n  aws cloudformation delete-stack --stack-name openvidu-e2e-aws-ce-a105835 --region eu-south-2\r\n\r\n  # The key pair this stack's deploy imported.\r\n  aws ec2 delete-key-pair --key-name openvidu-e2e-aws-ce-a105835-key --region eu-south-2\r\n\r\n  # The template this stack's deploy staged (the bucket stays: every stack in the\r\n  # region shares it).\r\n  aws s3 rm s3://openvidu-cfn-templates-***-eu-south-2/openvidu-e2e-aws-ce-a105835/ --recursive --only-show-errors --region eu-south-2\r\n\r\nWith --delete-data the S3 data bucket goes too, with your recordings and Meet data, after the stack (the template marks it Retain,\r\nso the stack alone would leave it):\r\n  aws s3 rb s3://<each data bucket of the stack> --force --region eu-south-2\r\nThe destroy leaves the per-account bucket the deploy stages its template in\r\n(openvidu-cfn-templates-<account>-<region>): every stack in the region shares it.\r\n── end of plan ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
